WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.340
A preparer's portal hands you a zip.

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:10.475
There's a driver's license in it, forms named whatever, and some of them twice.

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:13.505
Every number, traced to its page.

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:18.702
Once your documents are imported, this page shows them sorted by tax year,

00:00:18.702 --> 00:00:21.545
with filed returns in a folder of their own.

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:27.586
To import, point taxtrace at the folder or the zip.

00:00:27.586 --> 00:00:33.018
Each file goes to its tax year, last year's filed return goes to prior-returns,

00:00:33.018 --> 00:00:36.799
and the driver's license is skipped: it's no tax input,

00:00:36.799 --> 00:00:38.930
and a copy not made can't leak.

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:44.080
Import the same folder again, and nothing changes.

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:46.970
Files already in the workspace are skipped.
